<p>Jord&agrave;, &Ograve;scar, Moritz Schularick, and Alan M. Taylor, 2011, &ldquo;Financial crises, credit booms, and external imbalances: 140 years of lessons,&rdquo; <em>IMF Economic Review</em>, Vol. 59, No. 2, pp. 340&ndash;378.</p>

