<p>Valletta, Rob, and Katherine Kuang, 2010, &ldquo;<a title="Is structural unemployment on the rise?" href="http://www.frbsf.org/publications/economics/letter/2010/el2010-34.html" target="_blank">Is structural unemployment on the rise?</a>,&rdquo; <em>Economic Letter</em>, Federal Reserve Bank of San Francisco, No. 2010-34, November 8.</p></div>
                        


        </div>
    </div>
</div>    
